  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In December 2013, the UN Development Group established a &#x2018;Delivering Results Together&#x2019; Fund (DRT Fund). Having the QCPR as its primary mandate, the DRT Fund is designed to support countries applying the Delivering as One approach by providing programme resources to fill the identified funding gaps for the achievement of development results. By supporting only Delivering as One countries,</narrative>
